{
	"name": "Vexillum of the Dead",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-skull-red.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>his horrifying banner is only ever seen flying over armies of the undead. This banner has [[/r 1d12]] charges when found, and grants the following benefits to all undead within a 120ft radius:</p><ul><li><strong>Radiant Resistance:</strong> Undead gain resistance to radiant damage.</li><li><strong>Turning Protection:</strong> Undead cannot be turned by Channel Divinity</li><li><strong>Shade of Night:</strong> Undead within the area that are affected by sunlight may ignore the effect of even direct sunlight.</li></ul><p>In addition, the wielder of the vexillum of the dead can expend one or more charges from the banner to produce the following effects:</p><ul><li><strong>Arise:</strong> Cast @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.evhh5s6v0ctzop82]{Create Undead} at 9th level. (2 charges)</li><li><strong>Bolster:</strong> Restores 10 hit points or 40 morale to up to 5 undead or 1 unit within 120ft. (1 charge)</li><li><strong>Malediction:</strong> Cast @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.339zx6f5jk81fobw]{Bestow Curse} at 9th level. DC 18 (1 charge)</li><li><strong>Slaughter:</strong> Cast @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.f64g6d7u9y9wxfij]{Circle of Death} at 9th level. DC 18 (2 charges)</li></ul><p>The vexillum of the dead can hold a maximum of 15 charges and recovers 1 charge when someone dies from the Slaughter power or while under the effects of the Malediction. It also recovers 1d4 charges at midnight.</p>",
		"favorite": false,
